# Semgrep ignore list for App-Vibe-Security
#
# This repository IS a detector. scripts/audit-native.mjs and scripts/scan-artifacts.mjs
# hold the regexes for the very patterns this ruleset looks for, so scanning them
# reports the detector's own definitions as findings. skills/semgrep-rules.yml is the
# ruleset itself, for the same reason.
#
# This is a self-reference exclusion, not a suppression: no application code is
# excluded, and the ruleset is exercised against real fixtures in CI.
#
# When you copy this workflow into your own application repository, DELETE this file.
# Your repository has no detector definitions to exclude, and an inherited ignore list
# is how a real finding gets waved through.

scripts/audit-native.mjs
scripts/scan-artifacts.mjs
skills/semgrep-rules.yml

# Fixtures are scanned explicitly by the self-test step, not by the repository scan.
tests/fixtures/
